WEBVTT

00:17.960 --> 00:20.980
children and adults a place to
practice staying calm under

00:20.980 --> 00:24.920
pressure, solving problems,
setting boundaries, and building

00:24.920 --> 00:29.720
confidence through real
experience. We welcome complete

00:29.720 --> 00:34.960
beginners, so you do not need to
be in shape, know anything about

00:34.960 --> 00:39.000
Jiu-Jitsu, or feel ready before
you visit. I would love to meet

00:39.000 --> 00:43.860
you at the academy, show you
around, explain how our programs

00:43.860 --> 00:48.000
work, and let you see a class.
There is no pressure and no

00:48.000 --> 00:52.680
obligation. Just come in, meet us,
and see whether it feels like the

00:52.680 --> 00:58.220
right place for you or your child.
Use the form below, and we will

00:58.220 --> 01:02.080
help you choose the right class
and location. I'm looking forward

01:02.080 --> 01:06.520
to meeting you and helping you to
take that first step of the

01:06.520 --> 01:06.740
journey.
